WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.917
- This truly is dangerously cheesy.

00:00:07.727 --> 00:00:10.093
- Mac and cheese inside of a Cheeto?

00:00:10.093 --> 00:00:13.639
- Or mac and cheese flavored cheese?

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:15.467
- Or is it like Cheetos
sprinkled on mac and?

00:00:15.467 --> 00:00:17.303
I don't know, it's a mixture of the two.

00:00:17.303 --> 00:00:20.144
- I could love it, I could hate it.

00:00:20.144 --> 00:00:24.509
I could poop uncontrollably
or I could just vomit.

00:00:24.509 --> 00:00:25.983
- [Girl] Ooh!
- Ooh!

00:00:25.983 --> 00:00:27.259
- The box is cute.
- [Black Shirt] Yeah.

00:00:27.259 --> 00:00:29.238
- Who thought this would be a good idea?

00:00:29.238 --> 00:00:32.634
- It smells like, (sniffing) vom-eet.

00:00:32.634 --> 00:00:33.690
- [Man] Oh my goodness.

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:36.796
- This smells like Pringles and Cheez-Its.

00:00:36.796 --> 00:00:38.059
- Oh God, these are good.

00:00:38.059 --> 00:00:39.708
- It doesn't look like it
came from the Earth at all.

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:41.083
It looks like it came from like--

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:42.103
- It came from Burger King. (chuckling)

00:00:42.103 --> 00:00:44.123
- From Burger King. (laughing)

00:00:44.123 --> 00:00:45.220
- Okay if you're drunk you're probably

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:46.353
gonna want this.
- [Man] Mmm-hmm.

00:00:46.353 --> 00:00:47.937
- Yeah, I just kinda
feel like I would order

00:00:47.937 --> 00:00:51.268
two boxes of these and then
blame it on somebody else

00:00:51.268 --> 00:00:52.650
like, oh I'm getting this for my boyfriend

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:54.996
and just go home and
eat both of the boxes.

00:00:54.996 --> 00:00:56.916
- This tastes like box macaroni and cheese

00:00:56.916 --> 00:00:58.703
on the inside, like Kraft.
- [Man] Yeah.

00:00:58.703 --> 00:00:59.632
- You don't really know where the

00:00:59.632 --> 00:01:02.025
Cheeto ends and the mac begins.

00:01:02.025 --> 00:01:03.233
- Are you eating a third one?

00:01:03.233 --> 00:01:04.066
- No.

00:01:04.904 --> 00:01:06.860
Yes. (laughing)

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:07.883
- I say good work.

00:01:07.883 --> 00:01:08.886
I'm not mad at these.

00:01:08.886 --> 00:01:11.369
- My stomach is already
hurting and I've had three.

00:01:11.369 --> 00:01:12.944
- (laughing) Why are
you eating another one?

00:01:12.944 --> 00:01:14.364
- What would we give these out of ten?

00:01:14.364 --> 00:01:16.623
- I would say maybe like
a, yeah, like a six.

00:01:16.623 --> 00:01:18.889
- I would give it like a five.

00:01:18.889 --> 00:01:20.056
If I was a little drunk,

00:01:20.056 --> 00:01:21.104
I'd give it a seven.
- [Man] Yeah.

00:01:21.104 --> 00:01:23.237
- It's not as nasty as
I thought it would be.

00:01:23.237 --> 00:01:25.913
- You eat 'em once and you
should never eat them again.

00:01:25.913 --> 00:01:27.108
(smacking)

00:01:27.108 --> 00:01:30.168
- Finger-licking good. (laughing)

00:01:30.168 --> 00:01:32.200
- So it's, it's half an hour later and

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:34.393
we really don't feel that well.

00:01:34.393 --> 00:01:37.023
- I can't tell if it's
coming back up or going down.

00:01:37.023 --> 00:01:38.799
- It tastes like bad decisions.

